        "text": "Page: Gareth Evans (director). Sentence: Gareth Huw Evans (born 1980) is a Welsh film director, screenwriter, film editor and action choreographer.\nPage: Michael Winner. Sentence: Robert Michael Winner (30 October 1935 – 21 January 2013) was an English film director and producer, and a restaurant critic for \"The Sunday Times\".\nPage: The Raid 2. Sentence: It is the sequel to his 2011 film \"The Raid\".\nPage: Mike Leeder. Sentence: Leeder is considered an authority on Asian Cinema and International Cult and Action Cinema, as well as for his work in front and behind the camera, with his work on such projects as \"Fearless\" (2006), \"The Raid 2\" (2014), \"The Man with the Iron Fists\" (2012), \"Man of Tai Chi\" (2013), \"Ultimate Justice\" (2016) and \"Rogue One\" (2016).",
